{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmg3wqsxYAdimjVrShj1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I think it's אלטשולר שחם, at 0.56%. Menora was right behind at 0.57%, so I'm fairly sure but not completely.\n\n- **Screen 1:** It's dark, and with my glasses on I still had to lean in. \"קופת גמל להשקעה\" was already marked in green, and so was \"עוקב מדדי מניות 11\", so I didn't touch anything. I looked for a way to put them in order by fee and didn't see one I trusted. The little sentence says the list goes from biggest to smallest company, not by fee. The yellow-brown bar says \"נתוני הרשות לא עודכנו מאז ספטמבר 2026\". It sounds like a warning, but I don't know what it means for me.\n- **Screen 2:** I read only the company name and the number next to \"ההחיסכון\". מור 0.67%, אנליסט 0.6%, מיטב 0.65%, אלטשולר שחם 0.56%, הפניקס 0.6%, מגדל 0.62%.\n- **Screen 3:** מנורה מבטחים 0.57%, but it also has 0.02% on \"ההפקדות\", where most of the others show 0%. אינפיניטי 0.65%. איילון says \"עוד לא דווח\", meaning nothing reported, and it's marked \"חדש\". A company I never heard of with no fee shown, I wouldn't go near.\n- **The lowest:** אלטשולר שחם 0.56%. I know that name, it's a big one.\n\n**What I skipped and didn't understand:**\n- I didn't look at the little circles, or \"מט\"ח\" with \"4%\" and \"99%\". I don't know what those mean.\n- The \"3 שנים 25.86%\" numbers and the many \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" I didn't count on either.\n- I didn't press the \"?\" marks or the arrows.\n- The top says \"11 מסלולים\", but I counted only nine companies. Maybe I counted wrong.\n- On screen 1 there were buttons with English letters, \"s&p 500\", and one said \"גמיש\". I don't know what they are.\n- The small grey writing at the bottom and the grey lines over each company were hard to read.\n\n**What worried me:** All the numbers on the dark screen. And I don't know if 0.56% is a lot or a little next to what my bank takes. I'd still ask the bank, or you, before moving any money."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1814,"cache_read_input_tokens":7802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1814},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"063c3400-08b8-482a-a022-27ffa0c99409","uuid":"994f8232-ce5c-4e18-ad2d-a7b9b5f90da1","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:28:19.978Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmg3wbVarzdozbKxxinH"}
